# k.procedures/shards/from-knowledge: 16 methods whose steps are read off other knowledge worlds: compose a scene (k.scenes), arrange in a layout and put on an anchor (k.layouts), take apart (k.objects, k.parts), build from parts (k.layouts joins), dress (k.wearables), a person or a face of a role (k.people), a feeling on a face (k.feelings, w.face), a place on the map (k.geo, w.map).
