# arrange in a layout
@k.procedures.method.arrange_in_a_layout k.procedures.method name="arrange in a layout" about="Arrange things as a layout of k.layouts says: group them under the layout, then put each into the first slot of the layout that holds its kind." act=group example="arrange them like a family photo" example="put the people in a row" core.source="hand-core 1"
