# take apart a drawn thing
@k.procedures.method.take_apart_a_drawn_thing k.procedures.method name="take apart a drawn thing" about="Take a drawn thing apart into the parts of its drawing (k.objects) that have a name: make each where it is on the thing; what has no name of its own (the body of a drawing, an unnamed stroke) stays as the thing." act="take apart" example="take apart the car" example="take the wheels off the bicycle" core.source="hand-core 1"
