# take apart into named parts
@k.procedures.method.take_apart_into_named_parts k.procedures.method name="take apart into named parts" about="Take a thing apart into the parts k.parts names for it (no drawing parts known): make each part, then remove the thing." act="take apart" rank=2 example="take apart a piano" core.source="hand-core 1"
